trigger5 (1.0.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Send partial damage updates under plane rotation.  Each framebuffer
    damage clip is mapped into panel space, aligned to 4 pixels there, and
    coalesced with overlapping or vertically adjacent clips before sending.

 -- Jeringa <jeringa@example.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +1300

trigger5 (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Send landscape partial updates per damage clip instead of one merged
    bounding rectangle.  Overlapping and vertically adjacent clips are
    coalesced first.

 -- Jeringa <jeringa@example.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +1300

trigger5 (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Align partial-update damage rectangles to 4 pixels in the driver.  The
    adapter corrupts the image for 1- and 2-pixel aligned row starts and
    widths; 4 pixels is the smallest working boundary.

 -- Jeringa <jeringa@example.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +1300

